                                                "sense_id": "3a029f00-a236-3aa7-b3cb-ac0a69f0cf62",
                                                "text": "So when they said yea to this, he called to him his player on the theorbo and his player on the hautboy, and commanded them saying, “Play me a solemn music.”"
